C","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3038449430,"text":"こんな複雑そうな料理、一度見たくらいじゃ覚えられないって…それに道具も調味料もないし。","nextNodeIds":[110000514]},{"nodeId":110000514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":940628046,"text":"うん？それなら問題ないよ。","nextNodeIds":[110000515]},{"nodeId":110000515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":470517206,"text":"鉄板は平らな岩で代用して、油はさっき捕ったイノシシの油を使えば大丈夫。石でかまどを作ったら、木の枝や葉っぱで火を起こすの。","nextNodeIds":[110000516]},{"nodeId":110000516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":281395822,"text":"砂糖はスイートフラワー、塩は…この前、洞窟で岩塩をたくさん取ってきたから、数日分ある。","nextNodeIds":[110000517,110000518]},{"nodeId":110000517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3316538958,"text":"な、慣れてる…","nextNodeIds":[110000519]},{"nodeId":110000519,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":1682821358,"text":"えへへっ、レシピを思いついたらすぐに試したくなるんだけど、毎回調理器具を持ってるわけじゃないからね。","nextNodeIds":[110000520]},{"nodeId":110000520,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":3489955870,"text":"ちょっと待ってて、今すぐ準備するから。","nextNodeIds":[110000521]},{"nodeId":110000521,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153901,"speakerName":"エレン","textMapHash":4041265294,"text":"そこで何してるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[110000601]},{"nodeId":110000601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153901,"speakerName":"エレン","textMapHash":3276224934,"text":"ここはイノシシの生息地だが、狩猟禁止区域だよ！イノシシたちが驚いたらどうするんだ？","nextNodeIds":[110000602]},{"nodeId":110000602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153901,"speakerName":"エレン","textMapHash":3148718926,"text":"僕たち狩人は目先の利益だけを追い求めはしない、将来のこともちゃんと考えてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110000603]},{"nodeId":110000603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":2073427734,"text":"あっ…！そうだよね。","nextNodeIds":[110000604]},{"nodeId":110000604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":1390894206,"text":"最適な環境だけが、最高の肉を生み出す！驚いてこの場所からいなくなっちゃったら…","nextNodeIds":[110000605]},{"nodeId":110000605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":791557710,"text":"ダメダメ、そんなの美食界の…いや、全人類の損失だよ！","nextNodeIds":[110000606,110000607]},{"nodeId":110000606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2943641078,"text":"個性的な理解だ。","nextNodeIds":[110000608]},{"nodeId":110000608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":3366938654,"text":"ごめんね！まさか、いけないことだとは思わなかったから。","nextNodeIds":[110000609]},{"nodeId":110000609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153901,"speakerName":"エレン","textMapHash":215261030,"text":"とにかく、ドゥラフさんのところに謝りに行った方がいい。","nextNodeIds":[110000610]},{"nodeId":110000610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153901,"speakerName":"エレン","textMapHash":1480614422,"text":"彼は僕たち狩人のリーダーでね、ルールに厳しいからすごく怒ってるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[110000611,110000612]},{"nodeId":110000611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":404133750,"text":"どうしよう？","nextNodeIds":[110000613]},{"nodeId":110000613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":3881365246,"text":"うん、謝りに行くべきだと思う。悪いことをしたのはアタシたちなんだから。","nextNodeIds":[110000614]},{"nodeId":110000614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2609778262,"text":"一緒に行くよ。","nextNodeIds":[110000615]},{"nodeId":110000615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":1170817494,"text":"へへっ、ありがとう。この件が落ち着いたら、また料理を振舞ってあげるからね！","nextNodeIds":[110000616]},{"nodeId":110000616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":650731350,"text":"おう、安心しろ、おまえが忘れてもオイラが覚えておくからな！","nextNodeIds":[110000617]},{"nodeId":110000617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3427252990,"text":"じゃあ、出発しよう！ドゥラフは清泉町にいるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110000612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":747267950,"text":"この人の言う通りにしよう。","nextNodeIds":[110000613]},{"nodeId":110000607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1254642998,"text":"本当は分かってないんじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[110000608]},{"nodeId":110000518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3337030406,"text":"なんか大変そう！","nextNodeIds":[110000519]},{"nodeId":110000504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3479710974,"text":"スライムの液体はぜひとも気になる！","nextNodeIds":[110000505]},{"nodeId":110000505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":305407118,"text":"#へへっ、{NICKNAME}、だんだんとオイラの好みがわかってきたな。","nextNodeIds":[110000506]}]},{"talkId":1100099,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["1100005","2"],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["100061","3",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_ITEM_NUM_LESS_THAN"},{"param":["",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":1100099,"initDialog":110000401,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1012],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":11000,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":110000401